M.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2795238095238095,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":63576,\"title\":\"Fate/kaleid liner Prisma Illya\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fivwHxH3xddSkSyqonXtuydBpIY.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2771317829457364,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":63663,\"title\":\"Gate\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bCuJkIUg1n9etSYrrQKlQuSrigE.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2738095238095238,\"_genreOverlap\":2}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"It’s just the beginning of happily ever after for lovers Rapunzel and Eugene Fitzherbert. As Rapunzel reacquaints herself with her parents, her kingdom and the people of the island realm Corona, she comes to realize that there is so much more she needs to learn about the outside world and herself before she becomes Princess of Corona. Eventually, Princess Rapunzel uncovers the mystery of her hair's return and its connection to the black rock spikes growing exponentially around both Old and New Corona, with the help of her handmaiden and best female friend Cassandra, and young quirky alchemist Varian.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8t3iwOAgXSTnmwFjAIApZNKGLMP.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2017-03-24\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"What the Hair?!\",\"overview\":\"Rapunzel and Cassandra venture out to a wizard’s cottage to try and find out what has happened to her hair.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6JJMDAsk0HDyE1BaMqAfbVGxPQw.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2017-03-24\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Rapunzel's Enemy\",\"overview\":\"When Rapunzel gets booed, she becomes determined to win over her naysayer, a little old man who is loved by everyone in the kingdom.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1olqXnIo1o0w8d1hjwbo14YVBoW.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2017-03-31\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Fitzherbert P.I.\",\"overview\":\"Eugene sets out to find a role for himself in the castle and decides to be a royal guard, but to pass muster, he must overcome the Captain's preconceptions.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5DCrJN9mIVtaBqPFlrOksbYDlEs.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2017-04-07\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Challenge of the Brave\",\"overview\":\"When Cassandra enters the Challenge of the Brave, Rapunzel decides to enter the challenge as well causing both girls’ competitive nature to come out!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/KU3C3W2YRCpv5dOVdgnRd5oZ98.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2017-04-14\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Cassandra v. Eugene\",\"overview\":\"Rapunzel is sick of the constant bickering between Cassandra and Eugene, so she sends them off on a scavenger hunt as a bonding experience.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/v8a7sUNRKEzOt1lZClav0PEhT3S.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2017-04-21\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"The Return of Strongbow\",\"overview\":\"When Eugene‘s old friend Lance Strongbow sweeps back into town, he tries to drag Eugene back into his thieving ways.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/brrQ0SdxtBJZEnhQwtVvmhwYTNG.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2017-04-28\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"In Like Flynn\",\"overview\":\"In order to prank a rival monarch, King Frederic recruits Eugene to help pull off a scheme.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/78a6L3sWwXXPgbsbzTTRcC9kuN9.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2017-07-23\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Great Expotations\",\"overview\":\"Cassandra is given the chance to be a guard for the Judge of the Exposition of the Sciences, but only if she can complete her handmaiden duties in time.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/85hwUsAm4m3oYdF8fWYCyM0oN1m.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2017-07-30\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Under Raps\",\"overview\":\"Rapunzel discovers that Cassandra has a new crush, but could Cassandra's new beau be interested in more than Cassandra's heart?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4BR9W8yVidCSBFioEHUqMScGxo2.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2017-08-06\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"One Angry Princess\",\"overview\":\"When Attila is accused of destroying Monty's Sweet Shoppe, Rapunzel's the only one who believes the Pub Thug's cries of innocence.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/okBnUQJqode6fnm3p59RnUFnpKF.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2017-08-13\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Pascal's Story\",\"overview\":\"When Pascal begins to feel that he doesn't fit into Rapunzel's new life in the castle, he runs away and returns to the tower.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nhfCear1L1o5xTyHCe07Eih6i0R.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2017-08-20\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Big Brothers of Corona\",\"overview\":\"When an infamous thief turns out to be two orphaned little girls, Eugene and Lance try to turn the girls away from their life of crime.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vQkNL2xlclTA2DStH3FRbIHqERP.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2017-10-01\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"The Wrath of Ruthless Ruth\",\"overview\":\"When The Snuggly Duckling suddenly becomes haunted by its original owner, Ruthless Ruth, Rapunzel helps the Pub Thugs figure out the reason behind the ghost’s return.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nqMQ4QFVSoOd9hWTM7mmmvtSTfC.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2017-10-08\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Max's Enemy\",\"overview\":\"When a new crime-fighting horse arrives in Corona, it doesn’t take long for Maximus to realize his new stablemate didn’t come to town to make nice.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vpf73s7frRQKsvOPDD15UYDKnfD.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2017-10-15\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"The Way of the Willow\",\"overview\":\"When Rapunzel discovers that Queen Arianna has an estranged sister, she invites her newly discovered Aunt Willow to Corona.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bMBd3heSh5iOSCtUutDZHMRk0FZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2017-10-22\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Queen for a Day\",\"overview\":\"When the King and Queen leave town, Rapunzel is set to lead. However, when a blizzard threatens to destroy Corona, the Princess is faced with some tough decisions.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/P32gdNZT1lsooGTWSQMocQZyp7.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2017-11-19\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Painter's Block\",\"overview\":\"In the aftermath of the blizzard, Rapunzel's confidence is shaken. In an effort to get her \\\"mojo\\\" back, she rededicates herself to painting, and enrolls in an art class.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/j2NKEEN3EKq5r8qZLEuvP0gGdP5.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2017-11-26\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Not in the Mood\",\"overview\":\"Fed up with the constant bickering, Max and Pascal give Rapunzel, Cass and Eugene an attitude reversing potion.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8Am2602cUmU8HXCJTrqGUZg39Pi.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2017-12-02\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"The Quest for Varian\",\"overview\":\"When Rapunzel investigates a cryptic message from Varian, she finds herself on the run from a group of masked men.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ljXIOYOBG8ZdOF2Zi2kEct6ScXZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2017-12-09\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"The Alchemist Returns\",\"overview\":\"Rapunzel agrees to help Varian recover the sundrop flower, but the princess learns the young alchemist has shadier intentions than he had first suggested.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iGa8nKJJYLJruymUbYnOMd4WmhC.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2017-12-16\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Secret of the Sun Drop\",\"overview\":\"Rapunzel must face her greatest threat yet, when Varian, desperate to save his father, takes the Queen prisoner.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uwswbXKHOwXpBGlohllzbmDsv56.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-13\",\"runtime\":44}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2017-03-24\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}